 "text": "Hi, how are you doing? Make a few small changes that don't cost anything. Replace the pillows and sheets with fresh ones. Add some fresh flowers. A small bowl of fresh fruit and a small bottle of water go a long way. You can also hang some towels on the bathroom door to add some color. No one will think it' strange in front, but put the password on a little note hidden in the bathroom for the people visiting. That' a lovely touch. A few blooms in a vase will brighten up the room instantly.",
